 16:  * The ground is a finite 256x256 sheet with no side faces
 17:  * (`customGroundMesh.ts`). Past it there is no geometry at all, so those
 18:  * pixels are the scene's clear colour - and where a border tile stands above
 19:  * the water it meets, the sheet's zero-thickness edge faces the camera. The
 20:  * original client framed neither, because its camera stopped at a distance
