 703: /**
 704:  * The least the zenith must be under the horizon, as a fraction. Guarantees
 705:  * a visible gradient on a map whose sky light and fog colour happen to
 706:  * agree - without it such a map reflects a flat wash and the water goes back
 707:  * to reading as paint.
 708:  */
 709: const ZENITH_SEPARATION = 0.25;
 710: 
 711: /** Tiles above the water the cloud deck sits. Lower = more parallax. */
 712: const CLOUD_HEIGHT = 12;
 713: /** Repeats of the cloud noise per tile on the deck: a feature ~20 tiles wide. */
