 735: /**
 736:  * Raindrop rings - the drops landing on the standing water.
 737:  *
 738:  * One impact per cell per `RING_PERIOD`, re-rolled every period so the drop
 739:  * moves and a cell can sit a period out; that re-roll is what lets the
 740:  * density follow the rain instead of every cell firing forever. The ring is
 741:  * confined inside its own cell, so the field costs two hash lookups rather
