 929: /**
 930:  * What the ground a melt uncovers is multiplied by at the centre of the patch
 931:  * - `WET_GROUND.colour`, on purpose and to the digit.
 932:  *
 933:  * Snow that a fireball took off the ground did not vanish, it became water,
 934:  * and without this the patch reads as a hole punched in the snow rather than
 935:  * as melt: Devias' bare tiles under its blue bake are a pale cyan (it is why
