249:       // its sprites by the object's own scale, so one recipe cannot serve
250:       // both:
251:       //  - Hearths (0.70-0.78, always sharing a spot with a 36) come out
252:       //    small, so spawn twice a tick to fill the grate and keep the smoke
253:       //    tight - it is going up a chimney.
