 15:  * `loop`. Effects are decoded buffers, evicted when they have not been asked
 16:  * for on the last `EVICT_AFTER_MAPS` maps (`evictStale`, from `sound.reset`).
 17:  *
 18:  * The two track gains are the *only* gains it owns, and `setTrackGains` is
 19:  * their one writer - `sound/index.ts` hands it what the sliders say
 20:  * (`sound/buses.ts`). The per-category share is folded into each play's own
 21:  * volume by whoever plays it, because a sound key belongs to more than one
 22:  * category and a track owns its sounds.
 23:  */
