1335:         // The live press, written where the body is this frame.
1336:         //
1337:         // Without it the only thing bending the grass was the trail, and a
1338:         // breadcrumb is only laid every `STAMP_STEP`. So the press under a
1339:         // running player did not follow them, it jumped three quarters of a
1340:         // tile at a time and sat still in between: the grass reacted in steps
1341:         // instead of moving, which is what reads as a slow, stuttering
1342:         // animation. This one tracks the body exactly, every frame.
1343:         write(a.x, a.z, flying, 1);
