1345:         // And the trail it leaves. A breadcrumb is stamped once the body is
1346:         // clear of the last one, and then stays where it was put - dragging it
1347:         // along with the body was the reason no trail ever formed. It starts
1348:         // recovering the moment the body walks on.
1349:         let nearestD = STAMP_STEP * STAMP_STEP;
1350:         let found = false;
